0..73 Comment "/// This source transports a Boolean along a composite of negation paths."
74..146 Comment "/// It follows cctt\'s `tests/bench/negPath.cctt`, a rung of the Brunerie"
147..189 Comment "/// ladder that cctt and gandr both state."
190..193 Comment "///"
194..265 Comment "/// Negation is its own inverse, so `ua` makes it a path from `Bool` to"
266..341 Comment "/// itself. The composite of `n + 1` such paths moves `true` to `true` when"
342..389 Comment "/// `n` is odd and to `false` when `n` is even."
390..393 Comment "///"
394..467 Comment "/// The checker computes each transport by conversion. The kernel replays"
468..506 Comment "/// each conversion within its budget."
507..510 Comment "///"
511..527 Comment "/// - see: #6268"
528..571 Comment "// The natural numbers count the negations."
572..578 Keyword "import"
579..580 StringLit "\""
580..599 StringLit "./circle-base.gandr"
599..600 StringLit "\""
600..601 Other ";"
